          6 guided exercises (Butterfly Hug, Box Breathing, Orienting, Body Shake, Cross-Lateral Movement, Humming). 60-90 second sessions when you're overwhelmed. Science-backed techniques for calming your nervous system.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Insights Tab -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl hover:scale-[1.02] transition bg-white shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-6 flex justify-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color: #3a5a8c;">
            <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
